==Swedish==

===Etymology===
Probably from the verb {{m|sv|blattra||to talk nonsense}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|[ˈblàtːɛ]}}

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|c}}

# {{lb|sv|often|derogatory}} A person living in a [[Nordic]] country who is typically of [[Middle Eastern]] or [[North African]] [[descent]].
# A wannabe gangster or immigrant who is not well integrated.

====Usage notes====
The using this word is often very frowned upon but most times it is used for describing people who act gangster to be cool.
The term generally means a mix of the two definitions (a non-nordic middle eastern or north african who acts ganster to be cool).
It's meaning generally depends on context just like the word {{l|sv|bög}} but blatte is much more frowned upon using than {{l|sv|bög}}.

The pejorative definition term has been reclaimed by some similar to the word {{l|en|nigger}} by african americans.

